  "title": "Nutty Yogi Banana Muffins",
  "description": "These nutty muffins made with teff and brown rice flours and sweetened with mashed bananas are a kid-approved, gluten-free, vegan treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Fran Prudhomme"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-04T00:06:33-04:00",
